==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|eo|de|Heim}} and {{bor|eo|yi|היים}}, both ultimately from {{der|eo|gem-pro|*haimaz||home, house, village}}. Distantly related to {{m|eo|Bohemio||[[Bohemia]]}} (from {{noncog|fr|Bohême}}, via {{noncog|LL.|Boiohaemum}}).

